[
  {
    "id": 1,
    "start": "00:00:00.000",
    "end": "00:00:07.800",
    "text": "你在看什么？",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "好奇",
    "voice": "语气随意",
    "music": "轻柔的背景音乐",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "start": "00:00:12.300",
    "end": "00:00:27.400",
    "text": "你怕我？还是嫌弃我？我身上有味道吗？不可能吧，我刚刚才洗的澡，而且我用的沐浴露跟洗发水都跟你是一样的，茉莉花香的，挺香的。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "略带疑惑",
    "voice": "语速稍快，语气自然",
    "music": "轻快俏皮的背景音乐",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "start": "00:00:28.000",
    "end": "00:00:32.500",
    "text": "从今天起，你搬到隔壁，那也是我的房子。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "语气冷淡",
    "voice": "声音低沉，语速平缓",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "start": "00:00:33.500",
    "end": "00:00:41.800",
    "text": "哼，老公，分居呢，不利于夫妻感情，我们还怎么要孩子？嗯。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "撒娇",
    "voice": "语调柔和，带着亲昵感",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "start": "00:00:42.100",
    "end": "00:00:48.100",
    "text": "别喊我老公，一年后我就会去死，到时候我们什么关系也没有。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "冷漠决绝",
    "voice": "声音低沉，语气严肃",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "start": "00:00:48.600",
    "end": "00:01:03.000",
    "text": "那你现在不还没死呢吗，等你死了再说，而且你死了以后就是死老公了，问题不大。礼尚往来，你也可以叫我老婆，我不介意的。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "轻松调侃",
    "voice": "语气活泼",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "start": "00:01:04.700",
    "end": "00:01:06.500",
    "text": "这辈子都不可能叫。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "坚决",
    "voice": "语气笃定",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "start": "00:01:09.600",
    "end": "00:01:14.000",
    "text": "啊，对了，这两天我过来还没来得及参观呢，我可以参观吗？",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "好奇",
    "voice": "语气轻快",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "start": "00:01:15.500",
    "end": "00:01:16.300",
    "text": "随便。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "平淡",
    "voice": "语速平缓",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "start": "00:01:17.300",
    "end": "00:01:17.900",
    "text": "谢谢。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "愉悦",
    "voice": "语气轻快",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "start": "00:01:22.500",
    "end": "00:01:26.700",
    "text": "少夫人，这里是厨房，这里是客房。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "恭敬",
    "voice": "语气正式",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "start": "00:01:28.800",
    "end": "00:01:29.200",
    "text": "嗯。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "平淡",
    "voice": "轻声回应",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "start": "00:01:29.700",
    "end": "00:01:32.200",
    "text": "这个房间，少爷不允许任何人进去。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "恭敬",
    "voice": "语气正式",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "start": "00:01:35.500",
    "end": "00:01:38.100",
    "text": "神神秘秘，不进就不进。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "略带不满",
    "voice": "语气随意",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "start": "00:01:41.000",
    "end": "00:01:43.100",
    "text": "这里是少爷的书房。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "恭敬",
    "voice": "语气正式",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "start": "00:01:45.400",
    "end": "00:01:52.000",
    "text": "悲剧的诞生，存在与虚无，他每天看的全是这些枯燥的书，怪不得想死。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "吐槽",
    "voice": "语气带着无奈",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "start": "00:01:54.400",
    "end": "00:01:57.500",
    "text": "少夫人，衣帽间需要我帮您收拾吗？",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "恭敬",
    "voice": "语气正式",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "start": "00:01:57.800",
    "end": "00:01:59.500",
    "text": "啊不用，你先忙你的吧。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "随和",
    "voice": "语气亲切",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "start": "00:02:03.900",
    "end": "00:02:04.700",
    "text": "老公。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "亲昵",
    "voice": "语调上扬",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "start": "00:02:05.000",
    "end": "00:02:05.800",
    "text": "什么事？",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "平淡",
    "voice": "语气平缓",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "start": "00:02:06.600",
    "end": "00:02:08.000",
    "text": "你能不能帮我个忙啊？",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "撒娇",
    "voice": "语气柔和",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "start": "00:02:11.500",
    "end": "00:02:14.000",
    "text": "你让我，帮你忙？",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "疑惑",
    "voice": "语气带着惊讶",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "start": "00:02:14.400",
    "end": "00:02:14.800",
    "text": "啊。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "肯定",
    "voice": "轻声回应",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "start": "00:02:17.400",
    "end": "00:02:18.300",
    "text": "陈明呢？",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "疑惑",
    "voice": "语气平缓",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "start": "00:02:19.900",
    "end": "00:02:21.400",
    "text": "陈明我让他休息去了。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "平淡",
    "voice": "语气随意",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "start": "00:02:22.000",
    "end": "00:02:22.500",
    "text": "张婶。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "平淡",
    "voice": "语气平缓",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "start": "00:02:22.700",
    "end": "00:02:24.000",
    "text": "张婶在做午饭呢。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "平淡",
    "voice": "语气随意",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "start": "00:02:26.600",
    "end": "00:02:28.200",
    "text": "我能帮她什么？",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "疑惑",
    "voice": "语气平缓",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "start": "00:02:29.700",
    "end": "00:02:33.300",
    "text": "哎呀老公，我真的很需要你帮忙。",
    "speech": "单人发言",
    "emotion": "撒娇",
    "voice": "语气柔和",
    "music": "",
    "audio_cues": [],
    "uncertainty": ""
  }
]